/a><a class=\"transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/sobre\">Sobre</a><a class=\"transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a><a class=\"transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/contato\">Contato</a></nav><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-5 lg:flex\"><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-400 transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/login\">Entrar</a><a href=\"#orcamento\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-white px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 transition hover:bg-slate-200\">Solicitar orçamento</a></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 lg:hidden\"><a href=\"#orcamento\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-md bg-white px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900\">Orçamento</a><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Abrir menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"menu-movel\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-md border border-white/15\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu size-5\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main id=\"conteudo\"><section class=\"relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-brand-navy pt-28 pb-16 text-white sm:pt-32 sm:pb-20 lg:pb-24\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcSet=\"/images/site/heroes/sites-640.avif 640w, /images/site/heroes/sites-1280.avif 1280w, /images/site/heroes/sites-1920.avif 1920w\" sizes=\"100vw\"/><source type=\"image/webp\" srcSet=\"/images/site/heroes/sites-640.webp 640w, /images/site/heroes/sites-1280.webp 1280w, /images/site/heroes/sites-1920.webp 1920w\" sizes=\"100vw\"/><img src=\"/images/site/heroes/sites-1280.webp\" alt=\"Pessoas trabalhando juntas no site de uma empresa aberto em um notebook\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"eager\" fetchPriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full object-cover\" style=\"object-position:45% center\"/></picture><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-navy/85 lg:bg-transparent lg:bg-linear-to-r lg:from-brand-navy lg:from-30% lg:via-brand-navy/85 lg:to-brand-navy/50\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-24 bg-linear-to-t from-brand-navy/80 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.05fr]\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-cyan\">Criação de sites profissionais</p><h1 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl leading-[1.1] font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-5xl\">Um site que trabalha pela sua empresa.</h1><p class=\"mt-6 text-base leading-7 text-slate-300 sm:text-lg sm:leading-8\">O site é muitas vezes o primeiro contato de um cliente com a empresa. Desenvolvemos sites rápidos, bem estruturados e encontráveis, que apresentam com clareza o que a empresa faz e levam o visitante ao contato.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row\"><a href=\"#orcamento\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition bg-white text-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-200\">Solicitar orçamento<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#como-funciona\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition border border-white/25 text-white hover:bg-white/10\">Como funciona</a></div></div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Ilustração: site empresarial no computador e no celular\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"relative pr-6 pb-10 sm:pr-10\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-[#111a2e] shadow-2xl shadow-black/30 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2.5\"><span class=\"size-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"size-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"size-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"ml-3 truncate rounded bg-white/5 px-3 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-slate-400\">www.suaempresa.com.br</span></div><div class=\"p-5 sm:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"h-3 w-20 rounded bg-white/25\"></span><span class=\"hidden gap-3 sm:flex\"><span class=\"h-2 w-10 rounded bg-white/10\"></span><span class=\"h-2 w-10 rounded bg-white/10\"></span><span class=\"h-2 w-10 rounded bg-white/10\"></span><span class=\"h-2 w-10 rounded bg-white/10\"></span></span></div><div class=\"mt-8 h-4 w-4/5 rounded bg-white/70\"></div><div class=\"mt-2 h-4 w-3/5 rounded bg-white/70\"></div><div class=\"mt-4 h-2 w-2/3 rounded bg-white/15\"></div><div class=\"mt-1.5 h-2 w-1/2 rounded bg-white/15\"></div><div class=\"mt-5 h-8 w-32 rounded bg-blue-600\"></div><div class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3\"><div class=\"h-16 rounded border border-white/10 bg-white/5\"></div><div class=\"h-16 rounded border border-white/10 bg-white/5\"></div><div class=\"h-16 rounded border border-white/10 bg-white/5\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"absolute right-0 bottom-0 w-28 rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-[#0e1626] p-1.5 shadow-2xl shadow-black/50 sm:w-32\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-[#131d33] p-3\"><span class=\"block h-2 w-10 rounded bg-white/25\"></span><span class=\"mt-4 block h-2.5 w-full rounded bg-white/70\"></span><span class=\"mt-1.5 block h-2.5 w-3/4 rounded bg-white/70\"></span><span class=\"mt-3 block h-1.5 w-full rounded bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"mt-1 block h-1.5 w-2/3 rounded bg-white/15\"></span><span class=\"mt-4 block h-5 w-full rounded bg-blue-600\"></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-20\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">O ponto de partida</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">Quando é hora de refazer o site</h2></div><ul class=\"grid gap-x-8 sm:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">O site atual não gera nenhum contato</li><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">Ele é lento ou quebra no celular</li><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">A empresa não aparece no Google</li><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">O conteúdo não reflete mais o que a empresa faz</li><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">Atualizar qualquer texto depende de terceiros</li><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">Não há como saber quantos visitantes viraram contatos</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 \"><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">O que entregamos</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">Sites empresariais: o que podemos construir.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-200 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Sites institucionais e empresariais</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Estrutura de páginas e textos pensada para explicar a empresa e conduzir ao contato.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Portais</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Sites com áreas restritas, conteúdo dinâmico e integração com sistemas.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">SEO técnico e performance</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Estrutura semântica, metadados, sitemap, dados estruturados e carregamento rápido.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Formulários e integrações</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Contatos enviados direto para o CRM, e-mail ou WhatsApp da equipe.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Gerenciamento de conteúdo</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Painel para editar blog, portfólio e depoimentos, quando a empresa precisa atualizar com frequência.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Infraestrutura e manutenção</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Domínio, hospedagem, certificado HTTPS, publicação, monitoramento e atualizações.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20\"><div><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">Para a empresa</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">O que muda na prática.</h2></div><ul class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-base leading-7 text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Presença profissional coerente com o tamanho da empresa</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-base leading-7 text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Contatos chegando organizados para a equipe comercial</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-base leading-7 text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Base técnica preparada para buscadores</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-base leading-7 text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Dados de acesso e conversão para decidir investimentos</li></ul></div><div class=\"grid content-start gap-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500\">Exemplos de como a informação passa a circular:</p><figure class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6\"><figcaption class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase\">Do visitante ao contato</figcaption><ol class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2 md:flex-row md:flex-wrap md:items-center\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Busca no Google</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Site</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Formulário</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">CRM</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Retorno da equipe</span></li></ol></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 sm:py-24 border-y border-slate-200 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-20\"><div><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">Incluído no projeto</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">SEO técnico incluído em todos os nossos projetos web.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-base leading-7 sm:text-lg sm:leading-8 text-slate-600\">Sites, landing pages, portais e sistemas com páginas públicas já saem preparados para os mecanismos de busca, sem custo à parte.</p></div><p class=\"mt-6 border-l-2 border-brand-blue pl-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Nos sistemas web, só as páginas públicas relevantes são indexadas. Painéis, áreas autenticadas, dados de clientes e informações comerciais privadas ficam fora dos buscadores.</p></div><div><ul class=\"grid gap-x-8 sm:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 border-t border-slate-200 py-3.5 text-[15px] text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Estrutura HTML semântica</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 border-t border-slate-200 py-3.5 text-[15px] text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Metadados individualizados por página</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 border-t border-slate-200 py-3.5 text-[15px] text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Sitemap XML</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 border-t border-slate-200 py-3.5 text-[15px] text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>URLs amigáveis</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 border-t border-slate-200 py-3.5 text-[15px] text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Canonical</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 border-t border-slate-200 py-3.5 text-[15px] text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Dados estruturados pertinentes</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 border-t border-slate-200 py-3.5 text-[15px] text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Otimização técnica de carregamento</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 border-t border-slate-200 py-3.5 text-[15px] text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Configuração de indexabilidade</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 border-t border-slate-200 py-3.5 text-[15px] text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Compatibilidade com mecanismos de busca</li></ul><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500\">Produção contínua de conteúdo, monitoramento de posições e consultoria fazem parte do serviço de SEO profissional, contratado à parte.<!-- --> <a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold text-brand-blue hover:text-brand-blue-hover\" href=\"/seo-tecnico-e-otimizacao-de-sites\">Conhecer o SEO profissional<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></p></div></div></section><section id=\"como-funciona\" class=\"scroll-mt-20 bg-brand-navy py-20 text-white sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 \"><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-cyan\">Como funciona</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-white\">Primeiro entendemos o processo. Depois desenvolvemos a solução.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-12\"><ol class=\"grid gap-x-6 gap-y-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-6\"><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">01</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Entendimento</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Entendemos o processo, as pessoas envolvidas e o problema a resolver.</p></li><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">02</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Planejamento</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Definimos solução, arquitetura, prioridades e etapas de entrega.</p></li><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">03</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Desenvolvimento</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Construímos em etapas, com validação a cada entrega.</p></li><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">04</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Integração</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Conectamos os sistemas e ferramentas que a operação já usa.</p></li><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">05</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Implantação</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Colocamos em produção, migramos dados e preparamos a equipe.</p></li><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">06</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Evolução</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Mantemos, acompanhamos e melhoramos continuamente.</p></li></ol></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_0.7fr]\"><div><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">Perguntas frequentes</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">Dúvidas comuns.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><div class=\"divide-y divide-slate-200 border-y border-slate-200\"><div data-state=\"open\" data-slot=\"collapsible\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_cne_\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-state=\"open\" data-slot=\"collapsible-trigger\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Quanto custa um site profissional?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform rotate-180\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div data-state=\"open\" id=\"radix-_R_cne_\" data-slot=\"collapsible-content\" class=\"pb-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600 data-[state=closed]:hidden\">Depende do número de páginas, das integrações e da necessidade de painel de conteúdo. Depois de uma conversa breve, enviamos uma proposta com escopo e prazo definidos.</div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible-trigger\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">O site vai aparecer no Google?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_kne_\" data-slot=\"collapsible-content\" class=\"pb-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600 data-[state=closed]:hidden\">Todo projeto nasce com SEO técnico, conteúdo estruturado e boa performance. O posicionamento também depende da concorrência e da produção contínua de conteúdo.</div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible-trigger\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Vocês cuidam de domínio e hospedagem?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_sne_\" data-slot=\"collapsible-content\" class=\"pb-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600 data-[state=closed]:hidden\">Sim. Orientamos e configuramos domínio, hospedagem, certificado de segurança e publicação.</div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible-trigger\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Consigo atualizar o site sozinho?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_14ne_\" data-slot=\"collapsible-content\" class=\"pb-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600 data-[state=closed]:hidden\">Quando faz sentido, o site inclui painel para editar blog, portfólio e outros conteúdos. Para mudanças estruturais, a manutenção fica com a nossa equipe.</div></div></div></div></div><aside><h2 class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase\">Soluções relacionadas</h2><ul class=\"mt-4 divide-y divide-slate-200 border-y border-slate-200\"><li><a class=\"group flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-4\" href=\"/criacao-de-landing-pages\"><span><span class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-brand-blue-hover\">Landing Pages</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Páginas focadas em um objetivo — campanha, lançamento ou captação — com contato direto no CRM.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"group flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-4\" href=\"/seo-tecnico-e-otimizacao-de-sites\"><span><span class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-brand-blue-hover\">SEO e performance</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Auditoria, correções técnicas e acompanhamento para sites e aplicações que já estão no ar serem encontrados nas buscas.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"group flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-4\" href=\"/integracao-de-sistemas-e-apis\"><span><span class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-brand-blue-hover\">Integrações e APIs</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Sistemas, plataformas e aplicativos trocando dados entre si, sem redigitação e sem planilha no meio.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li></ul></aside></div></section><section id=\"orcamento\" class=\"scroll-mt-16 border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid gap-x-12 gap-y-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:grid-rows-[auto_1fr] lg:gap-x-20\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">Orçamento</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">Solicite um orçamento: sites empresariais.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-base leading-7 sm:text-lg sm:leading-8 text-slate-600\">Conte o que precisa ser resolvido. Respondemos com perguntas objetivas e os próximos passos, sem compromisso.</p></div><div class=\"relative rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 sm:p-8 lg:col-start-2 lg:row-span-2 lg:row-start-1\"><form class=\"grid gap-5\" action=\"/contato\" method=\"post\"><noscript>O envio do formulário precisa de JavaScript. Se preferir, escreva para <!-- -->__AB_EMAIL__<!-- -->.</noscript><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"grid content-start gap-2\"><label data-slot=\"label\" class=\"text-sm leading-none font-medium select-none group-data-[disabled=true]:pointer-events-none group-data-[disabled=true]:opacity-50 peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-50\" for=\"_R_18e_-contact_name\">Nome</label><input data-slot=\"input\" class=\"border-input file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground selection:bg-primary selection:text-primary-foreground flex w-full min-w-0 rounded-md border px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-xs transition-[color,box-shadow] outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-7 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive h-11 bg-white\" id=\"_R_18e_-contact_name\" required=\"\" maxLength=\"255\" autoComplete=\"name\" name=\"contact_name\"/></div><div class=\"grid content-start gap-2\"><label data-slot=\"label\" class=\"text-sm leading-none font-medium select-none group-data-[disabled=true]:pointer-events-none group-data-[disabled=true]:opacity-50 peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-50\" for=\"_R_18e_-company_name\">Empresa<!-- --> <span class=\"font-normal text-slate-500\">(opcional)</span></label><input data-slot=\"input\" class=\"border-input file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground selection:bg-primary selection:text-primary-foreground flex w-full min-w-0 rounded-md border px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-xs transition-[color,box-shadow] outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-7 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive h-11 bg-white\" id=\"_R_18e_-company_name\" maxLength=\"255\" autoComplete=\"organization\" name=\"company_name\"/></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"grid content-start gap-2\"><label data-slot=\"label\" class=\"text-sm leading-none font-medium select-none group-data-[disabled=true]:pointer-events-none group-data-[disabled=true]:opacity-50 peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-50\" for=\"_R_18e_-email\">E-mail</label><input type=\"email\" data-slot=\"input\" class=\"border-input file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground selection:bg-primary selection:text-primary-foreground flex w-full min-w-0 rounded-md border px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-xs transition-[color,box-shadow] outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-7 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive h-11 bg-white\" id=\"_R_18e_-email\" maxLength=\"255\" autoComplete=\"email\" name=\"email\"/></div><div class=\"grid content-start gap-2\"><label data-slot=\"label\" class=\"text-sm leading-none font-medium select-none group-data-[disabled=true]:pointer-events-none group-data-[disabled=true]:opacity-50 peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-50\" for=\"_R_18e_-whatsapp\">Telefone</label><input type=\"tel\" data-slot=\"input\" class=\"border-input file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground selection:bg-primary selection:text-primary-foreground flex w-full min-w-0 rounded-md border px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-xs transition-[color,box-shadow] outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-7 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive h-11 bg-white\" id=\"_R_18e_-whatsapp\" inputMode=\"tel\" autoComplete=\"tel\" placeholder=\"(51) 99999-9999\" name=\"whatsapp\"/></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-2\"><label data-slot=\"label\" class=\"text-sm leading-none font-medium select-none group-data-[disabled=true]:pointer-events-none group-data-[disabled=true]:opacity-50 peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-50\" for=\"_R_18e_-product\">Serviço de interesse</label><select id=\"_R_18e_-product\" name=\"product\" required=\"\" class=\"border-input flex w-full rounded-md border bg-white px-3 text-base text-slate-900 shadow-xs outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-ring/50 h-11\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\">Selecione uma opção</option></select></div><div class=\"grid gap-2\"><label data-slot=\"label\" class=\"text-sm leading-none font-medium select-none group-data-[disabled=true]:pointer-events-none group-data-[disabled=true]:opacity-50 peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-50\" for=\"_R_18e_-notes\">Descrição da necessidade</label><textarea id=\"_R_18e_-notes\" name=\"notes\" required=\"\" rows=\"5\" maxLength=\"5000\" placeholder=\"O que a empresa faz, se já existe um site (informe o endereço) e o